menu "Mosaico Film"

    config FILM_PERF_TRACE
        bool "Performance trace logging"
        default n
        help
            Print timing and memory trace lines (log tag "perf") for the shutter
            timeline, the darkroom stages, JPEG encoding, NAND writes, the viewfinder
            pipeline, heap usage and per-task CPU load. Intended for measurement
            builds only: the extra logging and task snapshots cost a little CPU.
            Read the lines with `python mosaico.py iris logs --grep perf`.

endmenu
